{
  "app_id": 4390080,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Bottled By Bears is a cozy idle management game where you run a little honey farm with the Pawford bear family. Open bee packs to collect bees of all kinds, grow a flowery field that blooms day by day, and bottle the sweetest honey jars to sell at your stand. At your own pace, get ready to: Open different bee packs to discover new and rarer bees. Can you collect them all? Manage your hives and bottling lines to keep up with honey production. Attract new customers and take on bigger honey orders as your reputation grows. Expand your farm, decorate it, and arrange the flower fields that keep blooming even while you're away. Settle in with the Pawfords, manage and take care of the farm, and fill the hives with your favorite bees along the way!"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
